      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REAL CHANCE (4) chased the lead early from the inside draw but took over turning to score (19.87) at Goulburn in a Grade 5 over 350m. His last run is a proven strong form reference. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. JOJO GIRL (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 3.5 lengths behind Fear Not Franky in 18.97 and recording a new PB here. Should be in this for a long way. SCOTCH ALL ROUND (1) has found the minor placings here at last couple of runs, finishing third last time beaten 6 lengths (19.33). Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Well placed and gets her chance. DEL MAR MOXEY (8) cannot be dismissed although new to this distance.",
